#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:58
msgid "Cross-language consistency"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:65
msgid "Finds product and variation translations whose SKU, stock, tax class, catalog visibility, post status or prices differ from the original. Each difference has a severity: sync_error when the field is supposed to be kept in sync across translations (see sync_settings in mlstore/languages-overview), so the data is out of sync; deviation when the field may legitimately differ per language. Prices are not compared for a language whose currency has manual prices on the product (use mlstore/currency-price-gaps for those). Only translations with at least one difference are listed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:82
msgid "Fields to compare. Default: all."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:88
msgid "Also compare translated variations (SKU, stock, prices, enabled/disabled per variation)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:101
msgid "Raw stored value; null when empty."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:127
msgid "Original-language product ID (the parent product for variation rows)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:131
msgid "Original-language variation ID; null for product-level rows."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:139
msgid "Edit link of the translation (for variations: of the translated parent product)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CrossLanguageConsistency.php:160
msgid "Translations whose prices were not compared because their currency has manual prices."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:57
msgid "Currency price gaps"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:64
msgid "Lists products and variations that have WooCommerce Multilingual \"set prices manually\" enabled but no regular price in one or more secondary currencies. Customers paying in such a currency silently get an exchange-rate conversion of the base price instead. Requires WCML multi-currency; otherwise returns mlstore_currency_disabled."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:88
msgid "Secondary currency codes to check, e.g. CHF. Default: all secondary currencies (see mlstore/languages-overview)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:93
msgid "Also check variations (manual prices are set per variation)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:114
msgid "Original-language product ID (the parent product for variations)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:126
msgid "Regular price in the store base currency, as stored."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/CurrencyPriceGaps.php:140
msgid "Manually priced products and variations checked."
msgstr ""

