#: src/Abilities/LanguagesOverview.php:32
msgid "Multilingual store overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/LanguagesOverview.php:39
msgid "Call this first. Returns the store's languages (the default language is the source of translations), whether WooCommerce Multilingual and multi-currency are active, the currencies per language, which product fields are kept in sync across translations, and how many original-language products, variations, categories and tags exist. Other mlstore abilities take the language and currency codes listed here."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/LanguagesOverview.php:70
msgid "Code of the default (source) language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/LanguagesOverview.php:87
msgid "Store base currency; analytics revenue is reported in it."
msgstr ""

