#: src/Abilities/TranslationCompleteness.php:61
msgid "Translation completeness"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/TranslationCompleteness.php:68
msgid "Lists original-language products, product categories, product tags or global attribute terms that are not translated into one or more languages, with a coverage summary per language across the whole catalog. A translation that exists but is not published (draft, pending, private, scheduled) is reported in unpublished_languages; one that was sent to translation but is not done yet in in_progress_languages; a missing or trashed one in missing_languages; an existing translation whose original changed since in outdated_languages. Only objects with at least one gap are listed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/TranslationCompleteness.php:81
msgid "What to audit. attribute_term = terms of global product attributes (pa_*)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/TranslationCompleteness.php:88
msgid "Products only: audit published originals, or originals in any status except trash."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/TranslationCompleteness.php:93
